# Example plate list (for documentation only).
#
# On snowball, plates are passed as CLI args in the crontab line, e.g.:
#   track.py --plate BYP5855 --email-to christian.bongiorno@gmail.com
#
# --plate accepts any number of plates (space separated):
#   track.py --plate BYP5855 ABC1234 --email-to me@example.com you@example.com
#
# Plate format is whatever the Seattle Municipal Court records search expects
# (the "displayName" of the cited vehicle) — typically the bare plate string.
BYP5855
